%% V02 Test Seq 01
%% Concrete DnD baseline: FighterSeren heavy crossbow attack, no interrupts.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  actor Player as FighterSeren UI
  participant Store as Frontend Combat Store
  participant Transport as WS/REST Handler
  participant Service as ActionExecutionApplicationService
  participant Auth as CombatAuthorizationPolicy
  participant Economy as TurnEconomyPolicy
  participant Graph as OperationGraphStage
  participant Targets as TargetResolutionStage
  participant RollPolicy as Manual Roll Policy
  participant Exec as OutcomeExecutionStage
  participant Repo as UnitOfWork and Repositories
  participant Events as Event Publisher

  Note over Player,Service: Encounter setup\nFighterSeren HP 41, Heavy Crossbow attack modifier 9, damage 1d10 plus 5\nTarget HobgoblinCaptain HP 26, AC 18

  Player->>Store: select action.weapon_attack.heavy_crossbow target HobgoblinCaptain
  Store->>Transport: execute_action(req-2001, op-2001-attack)
  Transport->>Service: execute_action(command)

  Service->>Auth: can_execute_action(actor, role)
  Auth-->>Service: allowed
  Service->>Economy: validate_action_window and budget
  Economy-->>Service: allowed

  Service->>Graph: build_operation_graph(operation_specs)
  Graph-->>Service: linearized order [op-2001-attack]
  Service->>Targets: resolve_targets(op-2001-attack explicit)
  Targets-->>Service: snapshot saved with request_id and operation_id
  Note over Service: Internal trace only: graph built and targets resolved

  Service->>Exec: roll attack d20 14, total 23 vs AC 18 hit
  Service->>RollPolicy: evaluate manual damage roll mode for op-2001-attack
  RollPolicy-->>Service: requires_pending_roll
  Service-->>Transport: ActionExecutionOutcome status pending_roll with roll_context formula 1d10 plus 5
  Transport-->>Player: pending_roll prompt for damage entry
  Player->>Transport: continue_action req-2001 submitted_roll total 12 die_face 7 modifier 5
  Transport->>Service: resume_from_roll req-2001
  Service->>Exec: validate submitted roll bounds and apply damage total 12 piercing
  Exec-->>Service: operation_resolved

  Service->>Repo: persist deltas and commit
  Repo-->>Service: committed

  Note over Service,Repo: State delta\nHobgoblinCaptain HP from 26 to 14\nTurn budget action spent\nstate_revision from R120 to R121

  Service->>Events: attack_result hit against HobgoblinCaptain
  Service->>Events: actor_damaged HobgoblinCaptain amount 12 piercing
  Service->>Events: turn_budget_updated
  Service->>Events: terminal_action_result resolved with revision increment

  Events-->>Player: deterministic public gameplay batch

  Note over Service,Events: Assertions\n1. Damage math is exact: attack total 23 beats AC 18 and submitted damage total is 12\n2. Exactly one pending_roll state is emitted before damage apply\n3. Public event stream excludes internal stage lifecycle events\n4. Exactly one terminal result for req-2001 with stable revision increment on replay
